  description="Red Moor Wood aquarium guide: what it is, how to prepare it by soaking and boiling, how its tannins affect the water and how to use it in an aquascape."
  keywords="red moor wood, red moor wood aquarium, aquarium driftwood, aquascaping wood, aquarium root wood, red moor wood Serbia"
  path="/en/guides/red-moor-wood.html"
  image="/style/img/red-moor/IMG_1439.webp"
